  "releaseNotes": "CalendarField, GanttField and MarkerListField now load the fields they draw with (title/start/end/color, X/Y/label, progress, etc.) even when those fields are not placed on the detail layout or listed in DataOnlyFields; previously such fields silently came back empty (markers at 0,0, events without titles). ApprovalFlowField action buttons carry data-system attributes (approval-submit / approve / reject / return / confirm / withdraw / resubmit) for UI test drivers.",
